  "goodToKnow": "Das Reptil is a reptile: Schlangen (snakes), Eidechsen (lizards), Schildkröten (tortoises), Krokodile. The German synonym is das Kriechtier (creeping animal). Germany has only a few native reptiles, like the sand lizard and the adder (Kreuzotter), its most widespread venomous snake. Plural: die Reptilien (rep-TEE-li-en). Das Reptiliengehirn is the reptilian brain."
